<title>USA: Bush Boake Allen acquires Aromatica.</title>
<headline>Bush Boake Allen acquires Aromatica.</headline>
<dateline>MONTVALE, N.J. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bush Boake Allen Inc said on Tuesday it acquired Aromatica Industrial Suramericana SA of Buenos Aires, Argentina for approximately $2.2 million.</p>
<p>Aromatica is a five-year old producer of compounded fragrances with sales of $1.1 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Bush Boake, down 1/8 at 25-1/4 in early morning trading, is an international producer of flavors, fragrances and aroma chemicals.</p>
</text>
